{"3199930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legends of Boom", "steam_appid": 3199930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Boom</strong> is a fast-paced RTS-Lite Battle game, designed for players who crave quick, intense matches where you strategically place bases, weapons, defenses, and events on one of 24 different battle maps. Dive into the single-player Path of Boom to earn experience, upgrade your cards, and unlock powerful strategies. Or, take your finely tuned deck-building skills online to face off against opponents while the  puppet sportscaster, Flip Rimrod (voiced Tim Kitzrow, legendary NBA JAM announcer), delivers play-by-play of every match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legends of Boom</strong> is a fast-paced RTS-Lite Battle game, designed for players who crave quick, intense matches where you strategically place bases, weapons, defenses, and events on one of 24 different battle maps. Dive into the single-player Path of Boom to earn experience, upgrade your cards, and unlock powerful strategies. Or, take your finely tuned deck-building skills online to face off against opponents while the  puppet sportscaster, Flip Rimrod (voiced Tim Kitzrow, legendary NBA JAM announcer), delivers play-by-play of every match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Legends of Boom is a fast-paced RTS-Lite Battle game. Collect and upgrade cards, and challenge both human and AI opponents online, all while experiencing over 4 hours of commentary by our vice-laden puppet sportscaster, Flip Rimrod (voiced Tim Kitzrow, legendary NBA JAM announcer)", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199930/header.jpg?t=1745870730", "capsule_image": "https://shared.ak